<title>LEBANON: Lebanon budget deficit 3,700 bln pounds end-1996.</title>
<headline>Lebanon budget deficit 3,700 bln pounds end-1996.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's budget deficit was 3,692 billion Lebanese pounds at end-1996, according to finance ministry statistics issued on Thursday.</p>
<p>This compared with a planned deficit of 2,428 billion pounds under the 1996 budget law.</p>
<p>Accumulated expenditure at end-December was 7,225 billion pounds, including debt servicing payments totalling 2,656 billion, and revenue was 3,532 billion.</p>
<p>The ministry issued the following statistics (in billions of Lebanese pounds at end of period):</p>
<p>	   Expenditure	Of which     Revenues   Deficit</p>
